  "subtitle": "There was no contest this month about the VMA, which goes to the \"built-in slide rule calculator\" shown in Iron Man's armor in [LINK:1963:TOS_50_iron0|TOS #50|2027-03-24].&nbsp; <i>Classic</i>!",
  "review_text": "[DEVNOTE: *** SUMMARY_BEGIN ***\n*** THIS MONTH ***0 graded stories over 0 issues...TOTAL WEIGHT: 0 grade character issue weight0.00*** LAST MONTH ***8 graded stories over 6 issues...TOTAL WEIGHT: 4.58 grade character issue   weight 6.5   asm       ASM #8  0.75 6.5   ff        FF #22  1.00 4.5   iron      TOS #49 0.75 4.0   thor      JIM #99 0.50 4.0   giant     TTA #51 0.50 2.0   asm       ASM #8  0.25 2.0   strange   ST #116 0.33 1.5   torch     ST #116 0.504.51\n*** SUMMARY_END ***]",
  "letters_page": "[HANG0] * Introduction of Electro, Mandarin, the Blob and Black Knight (Nathan Garrett -- not that <i>other</i> Black Knight!)\n[HANG0] * Sub-Mariner/Hulk \"super villain team-up\" in Avengers\n[HANG0] * Improved characterization of the X-Men, perhaps in response to readers who were saying they were no different than the FF, particularly the Beast.\n\n[DEVNOTE: *** INTRODUCTION_BEGIN ***\n*** INTRODUCTION_END ***]\n[DEVNOTE: *** HIGHLIGHTS_BEGIN ***]\n[DEVNOTE: *** HIGHLIGHTS_END ***]",
  "ownership": "The end of the 1963 calendar year promises the following:\n[HANG0] * the Tomorrow Man is back to plague Thor\n[HANG0] * the Porcupine returns to annoy Giant-Man and the Wasp\n[HANG0] * the Human Torch has to contend with the Wizard yet again\n[HANG0] * Doctor Strange meets a bunch of possessed people\n[HANG0] * A terrible infant is on the loose, and the FF have to reign him in somehow\n[HANG0] * Iron Man is menaced by a scarecrow\n[HANG0] * and who the heck is the Big Man and his Enforcers?&nbsp; Let's hope that Spider-Man doesn't have to learn the hard way!"
